data/tiny_shakespeare.txt is public-domain text by William Shakespeare,
in the single-file form Andrej Karpathy assembled for char-rnn.

The lessons fetch two datasets: TinyStories by Ronen Eldan and Yuanzhi Li, under
CDLA-Sharing-1.0 (gpt/data.py), and games from the Lichess open database, under CC0
(gpt/games.py, gpt/gpu.py, gpt/strong.py).
